# Platform Targets

- Supported runtimes/browsers/OS come from `project-context`—do not invent bleeding-edge APIs.
- Align local/CI/prod major versions.
- Polyfill/transpile only when required by declared targets.
- Avoid hardcoded absolute OS paths; document native addon limits.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/runtime/platform-targets.md`
